        <mxCell id="1117" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;align=left;" value="Atari PONG (drawing 000826, Rev E) — IC floor plan. 66 ICs in true board grid (rows A–H bottom→top, cols 1–9). Each DIP shows correct pin count, numbered in DIP order (pin 1 top-left). Yellow dashed = analog/power stubs. Pins are connectable; wiring added per section." vertex="1">
